    <string name="lr_tut_01">Welcome to Life Road. Travel one road from start to retirement.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_02">Tap Spin. The spinner shows 1 to 10, and your piece walks that far.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_03">At a fork, choose your road. Learn costs coins now and pays more later.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_04">Pay stops pay your salary when you pass or land on them.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_05">A job sets your pay. Higher tiers need a degree.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_06">Homes cost coins and sell later with a market roll. Owning one adds comfort.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_07">Family squares can grow your household. Each family member is worth 30 coins.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_08">Event cards bring luck or small setbacks. Cover shops can protect you.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_09">Short of coins? Borrow 50 at the bank, but repay 60. A fresh start costs 40.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_10">Memories come from milestones and are worth 20 coins each.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_11">A lucky coin lets you spin again once. Use it when the spin is poor.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_12">Reach a retirement square to stop. Earlier retirees get a bonus.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_13">At retirement your homes sell with a market roll. Then the totals count.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_14">Most coins, homes and memories wins. Ties go to the fuller life.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_15">CPU players follow the same rules. Everyone sees every card.</string>
    <string name="lr_tut_16">You are ready. Spin and enjoy the road!</string>
